msgid "Dodge Step"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.DS_MOD.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.DS_MOD.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Client-only automatic dodging for Shrouden.\n\nPortal summons: if you are in front of the boss within about 14 units, blink behind it.\nOptic blast: when the boss teleports near you to fire its laser, blink away.\nIchor pursuit: when the boss turns into a puddle and closes in, blink away to keep your distance.\n\nWortox uses Soul Hop first; otherwise, use a Lazy Explorer or an orange-gem King's Staff. Avoids dangerous landing spots and restores your previous weapon after dodging."
msgstr ""
